<title>USA: Wall Street stocks open higher.</title>
<headline>Wall Street stocks open higher.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wall Street stocks followed through on Friday's rally to move higher in early trade on Monday, supported by a steady bond market.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones industrial average was up 10 at 6,714 and the Nasdaq Composite up four at 1,336.</p>
<p>The 30-year bond was up 6/32 to yield 6.83 percent.</p>
</text>
